  "text_to_speech": "as y of the red came along this story started unfolding from it became a humongous project got a new computer system invested in Pro Tools um got some decent keyboards a couple of guitars and a full workking audio studio um which is something I never had before and started actually composing music for the first time rather than what I done my whole life which is play by [Music] actually uh learned how to read music learned how to write it and really enjoyed the process of listening to to to each violin part and and cello part and how the piano would interact and uh I I felt I think for the first time in my whole life you know like I had actually composed something [Music] the dance of the macbes was really based on uh the Sakari in the film Isaac the Roman I wanted to incorporate these dagger men that that assassinated really many of their own people um if they collaborated with Rome um some people including some Orthodox Jews that I've talked to consider them to be terrorists not unlike U Al-Qaeda um I think that's going a little far but they were a pretty ruthless group of [Music] guys",
